  <title xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Partnership with DIIS on strengthening UN peace efforts</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2" xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The overall objective of the cooperation with the Danish Institute for International Studies (DIIS) is to contribute to enhancing the quality and effectiveness of UN peace efforts, including peacebuilding efforts, conflict prevention, and peace operations in fragile and conflict-ridden countries. This will be carried out through a strengthened Danish engagement in UN&apos;s peace and security agenda including conflict prevention, peacebuilding, peacekeeping, climate-security and a human rights based and inclusive approach to peace based on enhanced research, knowledge production, learning and policy-recommendations related to UN peace and security work.</narrative>
  </description>
